    <item>
      <title>Former This Is It site on Wells Street will get a historical marker</title>
      <link>https://onmilwaukee.com/articles/this-is-it-historical-marker</link>
      <description>This Is It, 418 E. Wells St., was the state's oldest gay bar when it closed unexpectedly on March 9, 2025. It was also among the longest-running LGBTQ spaces in the country, according to the Wisconsin LGBTQ History Project, which has been working to get a historical marker placed at the site.</description>
